{"seq":5,"slug":"level-and-compensation","title":"SpaceX 职级与薪酬体系","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/spacex/level-and-compensation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"career-level-system","title":"SpaceX 职级体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/spacex/level-and-compensation/career-level-system","wordCount":1660,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"compensation-structure","title":"SpaceX 薪酬结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/spacex/level-and-compensation/compensation-structure","wordCount":1322,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"performance-evaluation","title":"SpaceX 绩效考核","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/spacex/level-and-compensation/performance-evaluation","wordCount":1654,"readingTime":7},{"seq":4,"slug":"workplace-survival-guide","title":"SpaceX 职场生存指南","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/spacex/level-and-compensation/workplace-survival-guide","wordCount":1560,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"spacex-职级与薪酬体系\">SpaceX 职级与薪酬体系</h1><p>SpaceX 的职级与薪酬体系反映了其独特的组织文化——扁平化结构、高绩效导向、股权激励为核心。本章从职级架构、薪酬构成、绩效考核到职场生存策略，全面解析 SpaceX 的人才激励机制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本章结构\">本章结构</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>文档</th>\n<th>主题</th>\n<th>核心价值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>职级体系</td>\n<td>L1-L6 工程职级 + 管理双轨</td>\n<td>理解晋升阶梯与能力要求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>薪酬结构</td>\n<td>基薪 + 股权 + 绩效奖金</td>\n<td>掌握总包构成与市场竞争力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>绩效考核</td>\n<td>Stack Ranking + 季度校准</td>\n<td>适应高压考核文化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>职场生存指南</td>\n<td>80+ 小时文化下的策略</td>\n<td>在极端工作环境中持续成长</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"学习路径\">学习路径</h2><p>建议按序阅读：先理解职级框架，再看薪酬如何与职级挂钩，然后了解绩效如何影响晋升与薪酬，最后掌握实际生存策略。</p>\n"}